<title>USA: Alameda Cty, Calif., COPs yield six pct in 2021.</title>
<headline>Alameda Cty, Calif., COPs yield six pct in 2021.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Wednesday it tentatively priced $71.1 million Alameda County, Calif., certificates of participation to yield six percent in 2021.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
<p>COUNTY OF ALAMEDA, CALIFORNIA</p>
<p>RE: $71,080,000*</p>
<p>CERTIFICATES OF PARTICIPATION</p>
<p>(1991 FINANCING PROJECT)</p>
<p>FIXED RATE CONVERSION</p>
<p>THERE IS NO RETENTION ON THIS ISSUE.</p>
<p>REMARKETING</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 09/17/1991	  FIRST COUPON: 03/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 09/01</p>
<p>INTEREST ACCRUES: 09/03/1996</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p>MATURITY		 AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>09/01/2021	     71,080M    6.00  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 09/01/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 09/01/2010</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, August 28, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on September 3, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Saybrook Capital Corporation</p>
<p>Pryor, McClendon, Counts &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>Artemis Capital Group, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
